# `dist/` is intentionally TRACKED so consumers installing trainer-sim via
# git-ref (e.g. VeloWorld/veloworld-ride) receive prebuilt artifacts
# directly. The `prepare` lifecycle hook still rebuilds them on consumer
# install, but a corrupted prepare run no longer breaks downstream
# typecheck — the committed dist is the source of truth.
